                                "sense_id": "d8723a4a-eda5-30d0-a761-1325657415c0",
                                "text": "There are two routes to get there. We're in a rush so we'll take the shorter one."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c5305a64-ef3d-4816-8097-723c0ecd9fd5",
                                "sense_id": "d8723a4a-eda5-30d0-a761-1325657415c0",
                                "text": "Basingstoke-Exeter will test this. From Salisbury westwards, it's largely single-track since British Rail downgraded it in 1967. There's a ten-mile loop between Templecombe and Yeovil, as well as shorter loops at Chard, Axminster and Honiton."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
